SUMMARY:OPTIONAL WINDOW: ACC one-to-one tutorials
DESCRIPTION:Booking window\, not an appointment: Round 1 runs 16 November
 –18 December. Book a 30-minute MS Teams tutorial on writing\, presentati
 ons or learning strategies. A booked slot must be added separately.\n\nCer
 tainty: Published\nUK time (Europe/London\, GMT).\nSnapshot: 23 November 2
